<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 Teselonqe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Teselonqe Asuntsis Xaafide Tiino Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Teselonqe</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tese.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Teselonqe Asuntsis</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafide Tiino Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Teselonqe, Roome gade yeze Maqedooniya awurajjas waanna katama. Phawuloosa Filphisiyusa dakkii hyanggideppa suuba Teselonqe woosa keetstsi essida. Maaqqoyezin, Ayhuduntsi ammantto ekkodes giiginttii bettide Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi, Phawuloosa tamaarssize, kiristtinna ammano timirttite ekkanxxide gisho Ayhudunts qanaatii, Phawuloosa timirttito ixxii phalqqida. Yinnii gisho, Phawuloosa gam77ikaayzin Teselonqe ashshii, Beeriya qitida (1:9-10). Suubappa E Teselonqe yellide wode eza maaddize Ximotiyoosa Teselonqe woosa keetstsa hyanidanno ees geeshi ohida.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa tiino kiitto Teselonqe asuntsis xaafide, ammanze asuntsana zorodesin mintsitsodes. E un ammanttisin un siiqitisi lo77o markkatitsito si7ide wode Xoozza galatane. Tiino E un gidda yeze wode akko fana yessi yezezako unttana tiirizane. Yinnippa Kiristtoosa lam7intsa ye7itibaz oocinttide oochitis mahe inggida. Yinna oochitippa fetta, «Kiristtoosa lam7intsa ye7itippa tiino hyayqqide ammanze asuntsi Kiristtoosa ye7ita inggize medhina de7o ekkodes dandda7ine? Kiristtoosa lam7intsa yo7ode ayde?» ga7inttizannifana. Phawuloosa yinna wottide wodito maadinttii, «Kiristtoosa lam7intsa ye7e ufayssar naagiter E yo7ode yellodes woppu ga7i yin oochito oochchote» yaga7i zorane.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Gele qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1:1</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa ufayssiton galata <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1:2—3:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanze asuntsana de7ogo kaalitse <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa lam7intsa ye7e baz <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4:13—5:11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssutsi zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-22">5:12-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xaatsi qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:23-28">5:23-28</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Phawuloosa Sillaasen Ximotiyoosa Teselonqe woosa keetstsa yeze asuntsis, Xoozze Adesin Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosas maaqqide asuntsis xaafide kiita.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Hawa. 17:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aadho keehatitsin saro yinttis maaqqe.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Teselonqe asunts yessin ammanon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Nuunii Xooz woossize wode ubba yinttana qoppittera yin gisho ubba wode Xoozza galatane. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Xoozze nu Aday tiino ammanora yin oochchide oocha, siiqora yin labbide labbitsito Yesuus Kiristtoosara yeze ufayssito ekkodes yin miinggi eqqide eqito ubba wode qoppane.<verse eid="1TH 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Nu ishuntso, Xoozii yinttana kadhizannon fa baz mahi yinttana dooridanno erane. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Akkos gayko, nuunii Wonggele doonara xalaala baayzin wolqqara, Geeshi Ayyaanaran Wonggele mintsii ammanora yinttis ki7ida. Nuunii yinttara gam77ide wode ubba yin gisho wayzi yezezako yin erane. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Yin gaama madha ekkikon Geeshi Ayyaana inggize ufayssara kiitto ekkida; nunan nu Laatstsa aazizuntsana maaqqida. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Yinnii gisho, Maqedooniyan Akkaya awurajja yeze ammanze ubbuntsis aazize maaqqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5-9">Hawa. 17:5-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Laatstse qaala yinttappa kezii, Maqedooniyan Akkaya xalaalas baayzin Xoozii yin ammanzanna ubba bessa sinttida. Yikke, nu gawude baz akkon baaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Nuunii yinttago hyanggide wode yin nuna mokkide mokkite yin, yin eeqito ashshii turon de7o Xoozza maaddodes yin maaqqidanno un fa ommite ohine. <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>Mahi Xoozze Na7aya, Yesuusa, Xoozii hyayqoppa dentsidanno, tiinoppa yo7odes yeze Xoozze hyanqoppa nuna ashshodaya, salloppa yo7odaya yin naagizanno markkidhane.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Teselonqe oochchide oocha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Ta ishuntso, nuunii yinttago hyanggidanna hyarii baayzanno yin, yin ommite erane. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Yezin nuunii yinttago Teselonqe yo7odeppa tiino Filphisiyusa katama waayinttezannon cazhinttidanno yin erane. Gaama nuna ixxize yezikon yinttis E Wonggele ohode fana Xoozii nuus mintsitimo inggida. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Nuunii yinttana zoride balitsera woy cimora woy genera baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Hawa. 16:19-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17:1-9</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Yezin Xoozii nuna beezuntsana ga7i faydide gisho Wonggele ohode fana nuus hyadara inggide gisho ohine. Nu yinno oochchize nu wozintto be7ize Xoozza ufayssodes fattin as ufayssodes baaya. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Nu miishe zhimbbarii worddo yinttana sabbitera yinttago yi7ikaayzanno loytsii erane; Xoozii nuus markka. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Nuunii yinttappa maaqqin woy melle as oodefan bonchcho koykaaya. <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>Nuunii Kiristtoosa hawaare maaqqidanni fana nuus koshshize baz inggote ga7i ekkodes dandda7ane, yezin intta fa na7untsana dichchizanni fana yin gidda ashkke maaqqida. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Nu yinttana kadhide gisho Xoozze Wonggele yinttis shaakke xalaala baayzin nu shemppito yinttis inggodes giigida. Yin nuus gaama al77o. <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Nu ishuntso, nu oochiton nu labbitsito erane. Yinttis Xoozze Wonggele ohitera, yinttana waaytsaame fana qamman awara oochchida.<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Nu yessita yin ammanzunts kalen Xoozze tiino geeshi, xillon borinttoosuntsana maaqqizannis yinttin Xoozin markka. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Nuunii yinttis ommite ommite yeliduntsi fa na7untsis oochchizanni fana oochchodanno erane. <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>Nu yinttana zorida, mintsitsida. Mahi fa ka7itumtton fa bonchchito gishinttodes yinttana xeegide Xoozza ufayssize de7o yin yessade fana yinttis mintsi ohida.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Yinttisin nuunii Xoozze qaala ohide wode as qaala fana baayzin Xoozze qaala fana si7i ekkide gisho nuunii ubba wode Xoozza galatane. E turii Xoozze qaala; Xoozze qaala ammanze yin gidda oochchane.<verse eid="1TH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Ta ishuntso, yin Yihuda sa7a yeze woosa keetsiten yeyga Kiristtoosa Yesuusa kaallize asunts fana hyanida. Un Ayhuduntsi waayitsizannifana yinttanan yin sa7a yeze asuntsi waytsida. <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>Yentsi Ayhuduntsi Laatstse Yesuusan nabuntsana wodhida; mahi nuna bay7ida. Un Xoozza ufayssosuntsanan as ubba ixxizuntsana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Hawa. 17:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Un melle atto yezin, Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsin attode fana nuunii unttis qaala ohizanno kayane. Yinnii gaar yiizii un nagartti xuu7ita kumode yellodes ubba wode nagara oochchane. Wurssutsite, Xoozze kachchi unttalla afa wodhdhane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Hawa. 9:23</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13:45</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14:2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:5">17:5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:12">18:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Teselonqe asuntsana mahi be7ades amudhdhida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Yezin nu ishuntso, nuunii nu ayyaanara baayzin ashora yinttappa shaakkintti eeratsi wode gam77idanne yinttana gaama amudhdhii be7ades koyda. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Nu maaqqii yinttago hyanggodes koyda. Taanii ta ommite yinttago hyanggodes koyda, yezin xalahe nuna kayda. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Yikke, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa ye7ize wode nu ufayssita woy nu ceeqinttize nu woytuntsi oode? Yinttana baane? <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Turo yin nuus bonchchon nuus ufayssi.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Yinnii gisho, nu yinttana be7anxidaane nuus genccodes dandda7inttaanxin, Ateena katama nu xalaala attodes qofa accida. <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>Yinttana zorode fana ammanora yinttana mintsitsode fana nuura wolla Xoozis oochchizan Kiristtoosa Wonggele ohize nu ishay Ximotiyoosa yinttago dakkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15">Hawa. 17:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>Yinnan yinttana yellide waayte yinttappa ooden suub maaqqippe. Yinna waayta nuus Xoozze qofa maaqqidanno yin, yin ommite erane. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Nu yinttara yeze wode waaye nuna yellodanno yinttis tiinidhii ohida. Yin erzanni fana hyanida. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Yinnii gisho, taas genccodes dandda7inttaanxin, «Oode erize Xalahe unttana fattanii nu labbitsito cer ashshikaayzara attaama» ga7i yin ammanttibaz erodes Ximotiyoosa yinttago kiittida.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Hyatte Ximotiyoosa yin kaleppa yi7i, yin ammanttibaz yin siiqitibaz lo77o wore ohida. Mahi yin ubba wode nuus lo77o qoppizannon nuunii yinttana be7ades amudhizanno yin nuna be7ades amudhizanno E nuus ohida. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Ta ishuntso, nuna yellize waayten madhite maaqqikon yin ammanttii gisho minggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Hawa. 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Yin Laatstsara miinggi yeziko nuusin de7o. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Yikke, nuunii yin baggara denggide ufayssitis Xoozza wayzi galatode? <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Nuunii yinttana be7adesin yin ammantte faccidebaz kuntsodes qamman awara nu kumutsi wozintte Xooz woossane.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Xoozze nu aday fa ommite nu Laatstse Yesuus nu yinttago hyanggode ogito giigizo. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Nu yinttana gaama kadhizanni fana Laatstsii yinttana fetaya fetaya siiqize siiqite as ubba siiqo yinttis gaantsi gujjo. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa fa geeshuntsara yi7ize wode Xoozze, nu aday tiino yin wozintta geeshin bore baayza mahi E yinttana mintsitso.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoozza ufayssize yessii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Wurssutsite, ta ishuntso, Xoozza ufayssodes yin wayzi yessades beezizako nuuppa tamaarida. Yinno yin tiinoppa yezide yessi, yezin hyatte yin tiinositippa aatsii oochchode fana Laatstse Yesuusa tiino yinttana woossanen zorane. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Nu Laatstse Yesuusa suntsite akko kiita inggezako erane.<verse eid="1TH 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Xoozii, yin geeshi maaqqade fanan olale hyanttaame fana koyane. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Yin fetay fetay, yin machchuntsara geeshshatitsaran bonchchora yessades beezane. <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>Xoozza eroossen ammanoose asi fana olale hyanttera amora eexinttippete. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Nu zaga yinttis ohidanni fana mintsii zoridannifana Laatstsii yinnii fana oochchiza ubba firddize gisho oonin hyantsesara fa ammanze ishaya qohodesin cimmodes beezoos. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Xoozii nuunii geeshshatitsara yessade fana fattin tunii yessade fana xeegikaaya. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Yinnii gisho, hyanna timirttiti qoftto ixxize ooden yinttis Geeshi Ayyaana inggide Xoozza qofa ixxane fattin as baaya.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Yin fetay fetay wayzi siiqodyezako Xoozii yinttana tamaarsside gisho hyatte siiqobaz nu yinttis xaafodes beezoos. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Mahi Maqedooniya yeze ammanzuntsana ubba turo yin kadhane. Yezin nu ishuntso, hyatten yin unttana aatsii kadhode fana yinttana woossane.<verse eid="1TH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Nuunii tiino yinttis ohidanni fana woppu gayde yessi yezote. Yin, beezize oocha oochchii yinttis yessades koshshize baz denggote. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Yinnii fana hyaniko, ammanoose asunts kale yin bonchchinttoda; mahi yinttana koshshize bazis oodesin aaddashaama.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laatstse ye7e baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Nu ishuntso, ammanii hyayqqide asuntsi hyanodebaz yin erode fana koyane. Yin un gisho ufayssi baayze asi fana azzanifete. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Nuunii, Yesuusa hyayqqidannon mahi hyayqoppa denddidanno ammanane. Yinnii gaar, Xoozii Yesuusa ammanii hyayqqiduntsana eera wolla ko7odanno ammanane.<verse eid="1TH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Laatstsii nuus ohidanni fana Laatstsii ye7ize qamma eera yellinttodes nuunii faxa yezuntsi, hyayqqiduntsappa tiinoos. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Laatstsii damma kiita ootsara, kiitanchchuntsi hyalaqa ootsara, Xoozze moyze oollera, saloppa wodhdhoda. Kiristtoosa ammanii hyayqqiduntsi tiinii hyayqoppa denddoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:51-52">1 Qoro. 15:51-52</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Yinnippa suuba, ye wode nuunii faxa yezuntsi, Laatstsara dhonnella yellinttodes unttara wolla salo ekinttoda. Yinnippa suuba, nuunii Laatstsara wolla medhinas yessada. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Yinnii gisho, hyanna qaaltte fetay fetaya mintsitsote.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Laatstse ye7ito giigii naagote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Ta ishuntso, hyanna hyanode woden agina yinttis xaafodes koshshoos. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Laatstse qammita kayzo qamma ye7izanni fana yo7odanno yin loytsii erane. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Asuntsi, «Sa7a saro, akkon hyanoos» yagaazin, maacho yelo dha7e aykkizanni fana dhabe un qoppikaayzin unttalla afa yo7oda. Un akko ogeran kessii ekkaama.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Maato. 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luqa. 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2 Phex. 3:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Yezin nu ishuntso, yinna qammita yinttis kayzo ye7izanni fana yo7odes yin dhuma baaya. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Yin ubba foo7o asin awara yeze asi; nuunii qamma asi woy dhuma asi baaya. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Yinnii gisho, nuunii mellunts genttizanni fana genttodes beezoos; nuunii barkkodesin giigii yessades beezane. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Genttizuntsi qamma genttane; matsinttizuntsi qamma matsinttane. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Yezin nuunii awara asi maaqqide gisho giigii yessades beezane. Ammanon siiqo xurure fana ma77i, atotits ufayssi omma gaddize ola meqo barneexa gaddii yessades beezane. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Xoozii nuna nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara kumutsi atotitsi ekkode fana doorida fattin kachchis doorikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa. 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Efe. 6:13-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Nuunii faxa yeziko woy hyayqqiko, Kiristtoosa ye7ize wode eera wolla yessade fana Kiristtoosa nu gisho hyayqqida. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Yinnii gisho, yin tiino oochchizanni fana, fetay fetayra zorinttoten mintsitsote.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi zoren saritse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Nu ishuntso, yin gidda oochchii labbizuntsana, Laatstse suntsite yinttana kaalitsode fanan zorode fana dooriduntsana bonchchode fana yinttana woossane. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Un oochchize oochiti gisho unttana gaama bonchchoten siiqote. Fetay fetera sarora yezote.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Nu ishuntso, nuunii yinttana zorane. Boozuntsana kaccote; zhashtizuntsana mintsitsote; labbiduntsana maaddote; as ubba dandda7ote. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Ooden iita gisho iita mahaame fana naaginttote. Yin wolisin as ubbas lo77o baz oochchodes minggote.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Ubba wode ufayttote. <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>Ubba wode Xooz woossote. <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>Ubba baza galatote. Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara Xoozii yinttappa koyzanna yinno.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Geeshi Ayyaana tama dhabsippete. <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Tinbbite qaala leqqippete. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Ubba baz fattanote; lo77o baz ekkote. <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>Iita baz ubbappa hyaakkote.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Saro inggize Xoozze fa ommite yinttana geesho. Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa yo7ode qammas, Xoozii yin ayyaana, yin shemppiton yin kumutsi galtto bore baytsi naago. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Yinttana xeegize ammaninttidaya maaqqide gisho yinno E foloda.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Nu ishuntso, nuus Xooz woossote.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Ammanze asuntsana ubba geeshi yeerinttera saritsote.<verse eid="1TH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Yin hyanna kiitto ammanze as ubbuntsis nabbabode fana Laatstse suntsite yinttana woossane.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatitsi yinttara maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
